[116] indent=0 block=359dbe27 H2
      "2026-05-07 - NRG product prioritization" {b fg=#337ea9}
[117] indent=2 block=359dbe27
      "[unsupported block]" {i fg=#9b9a97}
[118] indent=4 block=359dbe27
[119] indent=6 block=359dbe27
[120] indent=0 block=-
[121] indent=4 block=359dbe27
[122] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Cool. Notion AI is transcribing this meeting. Okay."
[123] indent=0 block=-
[124] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "So that's, oops. What just happened? What is going on? Oh my god. "
[125] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Okay."
[126] indent=0 block=-
[127] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Cool. I pulled up all of the projects in Linear and actually let's"
[128] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "just like start with Spock just to like go over all of them um all"
[129] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "of the in-flight work but that that is like sort of not winning "
[130] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "dart i guess um i mean we we're considering spec trading winning "
[131] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "dart but like it's not really um so i sent christobal the message "
[132] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "in the spec trading slack let me make sure you're You're in there "
[133] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "too. Okay, what you are."
[134] indent=0 block=-
[135] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "It's not really much product work left, so I figured the handoff "
[136] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "to Cristobal made more sense for this one specifically. It's just "
[137] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "coordinating the NRG testing and release. And I feel like it's "
[138] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "going to be a... Like I bet what will happen is it ends up being "
[139] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "The third week of May, like I bought everything will be ready to "
[140] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "go sometime the 18th plus. And I would push for no later, like "
[141] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "closing this project out by the 29th. Um, cause that'll be sort of"
[142] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "a month after we intended to do everything."
[143] indent=0 block=-
[144] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "So yeah, this should all wrap up. Did you have any like questions "
[145] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "or concerns with this one?"
[146] indent=0 block=-
[147] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "My only thought on communication to NRG, well, just wanted to get "
[148] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "your thoughts. Do you think... Like, do we want to show back tests"
[149] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "and stuff? I guess my only concern is I was looking at the TSRB "
[150] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "and the back tests. We do so much worse with this update."
[151] indent=0 block=-
[152] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "I think that we phrase it more as a scale I think we should frame "
[153] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "it as like, We've been monitoring the strategy in shadow mode and "
[154] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "we added some additional risk mitigation parameters. We want to "
[155] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "scale it live so we don't want to go live with the full thing just"
[156] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "to ensure that we don't have any big lost days like what we saw on"
[157] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "April, whatever that was. I think that's the right framing. What "
[158] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "do you think?"
[159] indent=0 block=-
[160] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Okay. So that makes it kind of sound like it's temporary. Is it "
[161] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "temporary? Maybe I haven't been."
[162] indent=0 block=-
[163] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "It is. So the goal is actually to scale it to the 250. Um..."
[164] indent=0 block=-
[165] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Sorry, I know the spec volume, but there's the-Is the like... "
[166] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "whatever spike Oh. Is that temporary? That like penalization of "
[167] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "spike risk. I think it is."
[168] indent=0 block=-
[169] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "And maybe we do need to talk a little bit about that specifically."
[170] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "And that's sort of part of the scaling is like right now we have "
[171] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "this, um, like risk mitigation measure in place until we have the "
[172] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "next version of our forecast models is I think framing. Yeah. "
[173] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Cause like basically the problem is that we don't, a, we don't "
[174] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "trust or we don't have full confidence in our forecast on a "
[175] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "day-to-day basis. And then B we're overexposed to the MEC."
[176] indent=0 block=-
[177] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "So I would imagine, and honestly, I don't know that this work has "
[178] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "kicked off and I should probably, um, Put it in my to-do list. "
[179] indent=6 block=359dbe27
