      "think we need to have some level of TSRB on. this type of strategy"
[470] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "I don't know, like... whatever, I don't even know what to call it,"
[471] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "type of strategy. with NRG. And so I think Cristobal would play "
[472] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "that role there with the strategy team. And then Sam, I think "
[473] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "like, this can evolve into a core feature of our platform."
[474] indent=0 block=-
[475] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Yeah. Cool."
[476] indent=0 block=-
[477] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Yeah, to that end, Like this one seems quite meaty. It's massive. "
[478] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "a lot of other stuff to do. Like, is there, has anyone done any "
[479] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "sizing of like the,Not yet. Values to be captured here. I guess "
[480] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "it's like a little bit ambiguous 'cause we don't really have other"
[481] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "strategies to be selected. Right now, so it's like kind of "
[482] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "building towards that."
[483] indent=0 block=-
[484] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Well, I want them to start just with the optimized and baseline. "
[485] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Because right now, when we tell NRG, like, this just happened last"
[486] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "week. Like, hey, tomorrow's looking really risky. We just lost "
[487] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "$500,000. Like, we don't want to submit a strategy tomorrow. They "
[488] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "don't actually use the baseline orders. Like, they don't care "
[489] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "about our baseline orders. They then have their desk manage the "
[490] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "volume that we manage."
[491] indent=0 block=-
[492] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "And so instead of having to be like, oh, like, hours 18 to 19 look"
[493] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "so risky that we don't want to operate at all, we would want to "
[494] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "just mix the, Optimize strategy with like 18 to 19 with baseline. "
[495] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "So I think that's the start simple but I do agree that this could "
[496] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "spin out of control really easily and so that's another like thing"
[497] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "that you guys should help manage."
[498] indent=0 block=-
[499] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "This is why I want Roman. running with this one in the near term "
[500] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "largely because I think he's good at keeping stuff efficient "
[501] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "enough that it gets done and doesn't run away. And then if it does"
[502] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "turn into more, like that's for the internal, like solve this for "
[503] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "our internal operators, strategy operators. Yeah. And then if it "
[504] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "does turn into more of a product feature, then on application, "
[505] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "then yeah, Sam, we can engage with you."
[506] indent=0 block=-
[507] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "And if there's stuff that goes to energy, obviously Cristobal, but"
[508] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "I feel like because of the ambiguity, I want Roman to help make "
[509] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "sure this doesn't explode."
[510] indent=0 block=-
[511] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "100%. Yeah, I think it starts with Roman and gets handed off. Or "
[512] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "like, I do want Sam and Roman to stay in touch on like what we're "
[513] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "building. And just because Sam will have like,Sam's customers or "
[514] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "users are our EQ strategist, Kyle, John, Raphael, Steve, and the "
[515] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Gunverse strategists. And so I think like though they make up the "
[516] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "user requirements and sort of like personas that we're building "
[517] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "this for. But Roman taking the first start simple SOBs totally "
[518] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "makes sense."
[519] indent=0 block=-
[520] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Oh."
[521] indent=0 block=-
[522] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "I can't tell, am I next? Yeah, you are. Can we... Okay, so timing "
[523] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "of this. Could we hold off for a few weeks on starting to scope it"
[524] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "out until spec trading is done and Josh has done the snapshot "
[525] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "order stuff?"
[526] indent=0 block=-
[527] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "The snapshot orders can be in parallel if Sean is driving that, "
[528] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "but I agree that holding off, I think the next sprint should be "
[529] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Roman confirming scope and tickets for, and Sean maybe starting to"
[530] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "think about the technical design, but then... There should be a "
[531] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "project kickoff for this in about a sprint or so."
[532] indent=0 block=-
[533] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Can I poke at that a little bit? Because didn't you want Sean to "
[534] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "do the timing thing?"
[535] indent=0 block=-
[536] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Yes, but I feel like that's easy. Like I think that's like..."
[537] indent=0 block=-
[538] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Three or four doesn't work. Yeah. That's fair, but I think what "
[539] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "I'm trying to do is we're As we looked at yesterday, we have too "
[540] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "many things going on. Like, could we say just not yet for two "
[541] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "weeks? Or will that really hurt us for two weeks?"
[542] indent=0 block=-
[543] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "I don't think it really hurts us. Let's just set the expectations "
[544] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "with the strategy team and make sure I'm not missing anything. I "
[545] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "can send that note. Ah. What's... Or do you mean who's going to do"
[546] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "the other order visit the this?"
[547] indent=0 block=-
[548] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Yeah, sorry. Who's not what?"
[549] indent=0 block=-
[550] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "I think that's mostly Matt."
[551] indent=0 block=-
[552] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Okay, so they're not. Yeah."
[553] indent=0 block=-
[554] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Okay. I think this is Matt, but it's a good question. We're like, "
[555] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "yes, the tabs are in order of how I think the work should be "
[556] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "sequenced and therefore it would be on. Lydia to help us like "
[557] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "determine who and when and so if Until everything before this tab "
[558] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "is done, it's okay to hold off on doing this one. But I will "
[559] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "confirm that with the strategy team today. Um... Where did that "
[560] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "TSRB thing just go? Did anyone notice I created it and then it "
[561] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "disappeared?"
[562] indent=0 block=-
[563] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "You might've made it an update."
[564] indent=0 block=-
[565] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Oh, did I? Shit."
[566] indent=0 block=-
[567] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Yeah, you're right, I did. Sorry, I'm not good at this yet. I'm "
[568] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "trying to get good at it, but it's taking me some time. The "
[569] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "learning curve is curving."
[570] indent=0 block=-
[571] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "I have to leave a meeting that I joined rudely late."
[572] indent=0 block=-
[573] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "No worries, we're continuing to record and I have to hop shortly "
[574] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "here too."
[575] indent=0 block=-
[576] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "You said you're going to talk to Roman, Carolyn?"
[577] indent=0 block=-
[578] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Yeah, I am. All right."
[579] indent=0 block=-
[580] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "Thanks all."
[581] indent=0 block=-
[582] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "And honestly, that was pretty much everything. Like that was the "
[583] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "prioritization and handoff I guess two so two for one um And yeah,"
[584] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "I guess we can wrap up unless there's additional questions or "
[585] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "comments. I'll figure out where that TSRB thing went. I think that"
[586] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "that doesn't necessarily need to be a blocker for anything or like"
[587] indent=6 block=359dbe27
      "you could start figuring out what a TSRB like that even looks like"
